#: ../../source/docs/modules/log.rst:3 59ddb7fd3d124a22bdd8b641d0d3d9e0
msgid "Log Management"
msgstr "日志管理"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/log.rst:9 fdf17ee61f054164a5dfed0ff1fd2fa4
msgid ""
"Allows the user to manage the dataflash logs stored on the autopilot. Use "
"``log list`` to view a list of the logs on the autopilot and ``log erase`` "
"to delete all logs on the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"允许用户管理飞控上存储的 DataFlash 日志。使用 ``log list`` 查看飞控上的日志列表，使用 ``log erase`` "
"删除飞控上的所有日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/log.rst:13 28fe5c683da540a7a5d58299c87e19b6
msgid ""
"Use ``log download [lognumber] [filename]`` to start to download a specific "
"log to the specified file name. ``log status`` to see the transfer status "
"and ``log cancel`` to cancel the download."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``log download [lognumber] [filename]`` 开始下载指定日志到指定文件名。``log status`` "
"查看传输状态，``log cancel`` 取消下载。"
